    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/167f4c3db451e7a442b2d56a377a2953.avif?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=147 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a realm of eldritch dungeon filled with dangers and monsters, <strong>three Survivors</strong> face off a merciless <strong>Dungeon Master</strong> in a brutal game of wit and reflex. Choose your side and step into a world of panic and pursuit in this cross-platform asymmetrical <strong>multiplayer dungeon crawler</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors</strong> play in <strong>third-person</strong> with better situational awareness and numerous characters to master. while the <strong>Dungeon Master flies over the dungeon</strong> with more focus on their prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Survivors goal in each encounter is to <strong>escape the dungeon</strong> without getting <strong>caught by a trap</strong> or killed by one of the <strong>Dungeon Master's servants</strong> - which requires a great skill, especially when the Dungeon changes every time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/15594fb742975dd2a1cc2130acb077b6.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=48 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors can either cooperate with the others or be selfish. Your chance of survival will vary depending on whether you work together as a team and build a strategy that beats the Dungeon Master or if you go at it alone. Will you be able to outwit the Dungeon Master and escape from their claws ?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/8a608d4a4200230562fc523a1a5288cd.poster.avif?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/8a608d4a4200230562fc523a1a5288cd.webm?t=1755033775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/2280e52f13b402b67f6b2181a22c911d.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is procedurally generated, so you\u2019ll never know what to expect and won't experience the same Dungeon twice. Random and unpredictable layouts, rooms, content and treasures.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/bcf7c88c51f78f7e129f35c3ef9b2c23.poster.avif?t=1755033775\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/bcf7c88c51f78f7e129f35c3ef9b2c23.webp?t=1755033775\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=342 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/0cb8d8f0cbfe1d178ab6d16ea9d3e7d4.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Dungeon Master and Survivor has their own deep progression system and plenty of unlockables that can be customized to fit your own personal strategy. Experience, skills and understanding of the environment are key to being able to Kill the survivors or outwit the Dungeon Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/fb300eb3ada892040e02c91345242391.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Dungeon Master you can choose and customize your trap set and servants. Familiarize yourself with the dungeon room patterns so you choose wisely and make the right decisions depending on your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/048cac243b3b568180dfffa5987dd187.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/1454e01adb29b9c807266079258111f0.poster.avif?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/1454e01adb29b9c807266079258111f0.webm?t=1755033775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/ab9b89050bf1e5d31149526fab53974a.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/9f41658e662334f909898dfe4e32e74c.poster.avif?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/9f41658e662334f909898dfe4e32e74c.webm?t=1755033775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/34e9a778434c34a164a1c3eccfaf5c07.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=45 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Dungeons teeming with mythical dangers and traps. wonder through narrow corridors, haunted rooms, Forgotten cemetery to discover valuable weapons, spells and skills, while using your dodge ability to avoid, trick and destroy the traps placed by the dungeon master. Inside procedural Dungeons You will never be able to tell how it\u2019s going to turn out. With atmospheric visuals, haunting soundscapes, and dynamic lighting make every run tense and terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/f96a87b2bb36abee9ca8d162f772ea8c.poster.avif?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/f96a87b2bb36abee9ca8d162f772ea8c.webm?t=1755033775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/a8fe64dd8bce1768800d4323959ec9ac.webp?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=46 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the dungeon rooms in search of resources and ancient techniques to uncover forgotten knowledge. Use or share your newly acquired weapons, spells, skills, and equipment to reach the end of the dungeon and face the Dungeon Master in a climactic showdown\u2014fight to determine who will emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/7df11a0956eddd27b1563a74e2a072f0.poster.avif?t=1755033775\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024560/extras/7df11a0956eddd27b1563a74e2a072f0.webm?t=1755033775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
