    "short_description": "In Dungeon Master, you either try to escape a randomly generated dungeon as a survivor or hunt down survivors as the Dungeon Master. It's a cross-platform game where your role determines your goal\u2014no place for luck or coincidence, just skill, strategy, and survival.",
